{"id":"leistung","lemma":"Leistung","pos":"noun","rank":2911,"glosses":["performance, accomplishment, achievement","service","contractual performance"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɪ̯stʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/De-Leistung.ogg/De-Leistung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Leistung","plural":"Leistungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin beeindruckt von deinen Leistungen.","en":"I'm impressed by your achievements.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"to impress, to impose","l":"beeindrucken"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null]},{"text":"Was ist deine stolzeste Leistung?","en":"What's your proudest accomplishment?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,null]},{"text":"Seine Leistung ließ nichts zu wünschen übrig.","en":"His performance left nothing to be desired.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to wish for"},{"g":"rest of, remaining"}]},{"text":"Seine Leistungen wurden anerkannt.","en":"His services were appreciated.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"recognized, accepted"}]},{"text":"Mein Chef sagte, er sei mit meiner Leistung zufrieden.","en":"My boss said that he was pleased with my performance.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"boss, chief"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"satisfied"}]}]}